          <Pad Id="G5KHcwxJhKOMQWhR3fwHoq" Bounds="2245,902,595,1024" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&amp;ACCESS RVP&#xD;&#xA;&amp;REL 3&#xD;&#xA;&amp;PARAM EDITMASK = *&#xD;&#xA;&amp;PARAM TEMPLATE = C:\KRC\Roboter\Template\vorgabe&#xD;&#xA;DEF RSI_Bunraku( )&#xD;&#xA;; =============================================&#xD;&#xA;; &#xD;&#xA;; RSI EXAMPLE: Ethernet communication with Bunraku&#xD;&#xA;; Realtime UDP data exchange with server application&#xD;&#xA;;&#xD;&#xA;; =============================================&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Declaration of KRL variables&#xD;&#xA;DECL INT ret    ; Return value for RSI commands&#xD;&#xA;DECL INT CONTID    ; ContainerID&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;;FOLD INI&#xD;&#xA;  ;FOLD BASISTECH INI&#xD;&#xA;  BAS (#INITMOV,0 )&#xD;&#xA;  ;ENDFOLD (BASISTECH INI)&#xD;&#xA;  ;FOLD USER INI&#xD;&#xA;    ;Make your modifications here&#xD;&#xA;  ;ENDFOLD (USER INI)&#xD;&#xA;;ENDFOLD (INI)&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Move to start position&#xD;&#xA;PTP {A1 1, A2 -90, A3 1, A4 1, A5 1, A6 1}&#xD;&#xA;;PTP $AXIS_ACT &gt;&gt;&gt; ther is no specific start position &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Create RSI Context &#xD;&#xA;ret = RSI_CREATE(&quot;RSI_Bunraku&quot;, CONTID, TRUE)&#xD;&#xA;IF (ret &lt;&gt; RSIOK) THEN&#xD;&#xA;  HALT&#xD;&#xA;ENDIF&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Start RSI execution&#xD;&#xA;;ret = RSI_ON(#ABSOLUTE)&#xD;&#xA;ret = RSI_ON(#RELATIVE)&#xD;&#xA;IF (ret &lt;&gt; RSIOK) THEN&#xD;&#xA;  HALT&#xD;&#xA;ENDIF&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Sensor guided movement&#xD;&#xA;RSI_MOVECORR()&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;; Turn off RSI &#xD;&#xA;ret = RSI_OFF()&#xD;&#xA;IF (ret &lt;&gt; RSIOK) THEN&#xD;&#xA;  HALT&#xD;&#xA;ENDIF&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;PTP {A1 1, A2 -90, A3 1, A4 1, A5 1, A6 1}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;END">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
